<title>USA: American Int'l Group unit sells notes.</title>
<headline>American Int'l Group unit sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from International Lease Finance Co, a unit of American International Group Inc was priced on Monday, according to sole manager BA Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER INTERNATIONAL LEASE FINANCE CO</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.65 PCT   MATURITY 4/1/2000</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.981  FIRST PAY DATE 10/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.657 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 22 BPS     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
